        "id": 1002751
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-11-18T02:07:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unfortunately no.  ArchType is stored in the CompileTarget property, which means it has to get copied to the new variants when ctx.CreateVariations is called.  That uses reflection, and reflection can only write to settable fields.  Unexported fields are not settable.",
      "parentUuid": "9d758048_85f68a47",
      "revId": "5b1c71d5b14742713c236ab40bf9e631ce134849",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
